    "assessment": "Original-view concern refuted by immutable metadata credit checks and new native full-membership-rebind case. Claimed owner race conflict refuted by exact revision+state acknowledgement in transition, also exercised by both funded HTTP race orders. Uncertain-response wake hint uses existing periodic AdmissionMonitor notification; preserve stable action ID and retry. Cosmetic copied inner callback names do not alter the tested contract."
